{"id": "integral-studies-late-federal-aid-returns", "title": "A withdrawn student’s federal loan refund was 103 days late", "seconds": 45.3, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "7d9b7b0098fc8456", "words": 137, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The audit table starts with a withdrawal in October 2019.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.57, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["The", "refund", "clock"], "sub": "Two refund deadlines were missed", "source": "late"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A $3,432 federal loan refund was due by November 30.", "t0": 3.69, "t1": 8.56, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "late", "layout": "table", "heading": "Direct Loan refund", "context": "Original payment table", "rows": [{"label": "Due", "value": "November 30, 2019"}, {"label": "Paid", "value": "March 12, 2020"}, {"label": "Days late", "value": "103"}]}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The institute paid on March 12, 2020, 103 days late.", "t0": 8.68, "t1": 12.58, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "late", "kicker": "Two refund deadlines were missed", "text": "When the money moved", "mark": "When"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A second refund of $922 arrived 41 days late.", "t0": 12.7, "t1": 16.68, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "late", "layout": "table", "heading": "The second refund", "context": "Original payment table", "rows": [{"label": "Due", "value": "November 7, 2019"}, {"label": "Paid", "value": "December 18, 2019"}, {"label": "Days late", "value": "41"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In another file, two spring loans were posted in October.", "t0": 16.9, "t1": 19.9, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "term", "kicker": "A wrong-term disbursement had a different return deadline", "text": "The wrong term", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Together they were $6,184. The institute returned them 31 days after the deadline.", "t0": 20.02, "t1": 26.19, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "term", "layout": "table", "heading": "Wrong-term funds", "context": "Loan return", "rows": [{"label": "Loans", "value": "$6,184"}, {"label": "Days late", "value": "31"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A prior audit found $5,640 in two missing refund calculations.", "t0": 26.31, "t1": 31.38, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "calc", "kicker": "A prior award year raised a separate calculation question", "text": "The earlier calculation", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A full review showed the institute had already returned more than the aggregate due.", "t0": 31.5, "t1": 35.36, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "resolution", "kicker": "A prior award year raised a separate calculation question", "text": "The federal decision", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "After the $3,432 refund, the next auditors reported no new late refunds in their sample.", "t0": 35.58, "t1": 42.06, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Next-year testing reported no new late refunds", "text": "Next-year testing", "mark": "Next-year"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 42.18, "t1": 44.4, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two refund deadlines were missed", "b": "A wrong-term disbursement had a different return deadline", "o": "Next-year testing reported no new late refunds"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "number"}